n></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 7 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1L1h9zgEeg/\" target=\"_blank\">来起舞吧</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a40e321ef9b9b981ec28e111c363ffa0dec70a43.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 6 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1phhHz8EPF/\" target=\"_blank\">即刻轮回</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7ef814b3a46b4555d1e3aec905bb622e4d4521ac.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 5 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV143eRzPEK3/\" target=\"_blank\">泡沫年代的奢华盛宴</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/898191b042070d47e028782f0a0f80862a868375.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 4 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1i2vAz3EUX/\" target=\"_blank\">揉揉头</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6ec6956e743cf5f73c4656ba4aba8d10d075da0e.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 3 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SfK9zPEL3/\" target=\"_blank\">不要听那姓T的话</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e3e43ede3d0d379f294a3bfc4a8730e07047da8b.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 2